v><div class="solutions-center-card-footer"><a id="link-self:R5dmlt7H1:" data-testid="solutions-learn-more" data-analytics="Telecommunications" data-analytics-type="eventDetail" class="awsui_link_4c84z_1xwtn_9 awsui_variant-primary_4c84z_1xwtn_145 awsui_font-size-body-s_4c84z_1xwtn_385" aria-label="Learn more Telecommunications" data-analytics-funnel-value="link:R5dmlt7:" data-awsui-motion-trigger="hover" data-awsui-motion-target="" href="https://aws.amazon.com/marketplace/solutions/telecom/?ref_=mp_homepage"><span>Learn more</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></li></ol></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="solutions-center-view-all"><a id="link-self:R1nH1:" data-testid="solutions-view-all" data-analytics="solutions-view-all" data-analytics-type="eventDetail" class="awsui_link_4c84z_1xwtn_9 awsui_variant-secondary_4c84z_1xwtn_110 awsui_font-size-heading-s_4c84z_1xwtn_408" data-analytics-funnel-value="link:R1n:" data-awsui-motion-trigger="hover" data-awsui-motion-target="" href="https://aws.amazon.com/marketplace/solutions?ref_=mp_homepage"><span>View all solutions<!-- --> <span class="awsui_icon_h11ix_qwp97_13 awsui_size-normal-mapped-height_h11ix_qwp97_97 awsui_size-normal_h11ix_qwp97_93 awsui_variant-normal_h11ix_qwp97_181 awsui_name-angle-right-double_h11ix_qwp97_210"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" data-awsui-icon-animated="true"><path d="m8 2 6 6-6 6" class="stroke-linejoin-round awsui-icon-glyph"></path><path d="m3 2 6 6-6 6" class="stroke-linejoin-round awsui-icon-glyph"></path></svg></span></span></a></div></div></section><section class="partners-section" data-testid="partners-section" data-analytics="partners-section" data-analytics-type="eventContext"><div class="section-container"><h1 tabindex="-1" class="awsui_root_18wu0_1waok_950 awsui_box_18wu0_1waok_24 awsui_h1-variant_18wu0_1waok_28 awsui_p-bottom-l_18wu0_1waok_432 awsui_color-inherit_18wu0_1waok_190 awsui_font-size-default_18wu0_1waok_40 awsui_font-weight-default_18wu0_1waok_81"><span class="partners-heading">Customer Success Stories</span></h1><div class="partners-story-container" data-testid="partners-success-story"><div class="awsui_grid_14yj0_1iwrc_9"><div class="awsui_grid-column_14yj0_1iwrc_50"><div class="awsui_restore-pointer-events_14yj0_1iwrc_221"><div class="awsui_root_18582_15yy8_9 awsui_vertical_18582_15yy8_56 awsui_vertical-s_18582_15yy8_68"><div class="awsui_child_18582_15yy8_13"><h2 class="homepage-header-section-title partners-story-heading">Vonage</h2></div><div class="awsui_child_18582_15yy8_13"><p class="homepage-header-section-subtitle partners-story-subheading">Tomer Zilberstein, Senior Technical Manager</p></div><div class="awsui_child_18582_15yy8_13"><p class="partners-story-paragraph">Teams at Vonage needed observability into all service data to easily detect problems and resolve them quickly. The company procured Epsagon from AWS Marketplace to gain insight into all its microservice workloads, go to market faster, and reduce troubleshooting time.</p></div><div class="awsui_child_18582_15yy8_13"><div><a data-testid="partners-learn-more" data-analytics="partner-success-story-learn-more" data-analytics-type="eventDetail" aria-label="Learn more Vonage" title="Learn more Vonage" class="awsui_button_vjswe_1gf7k_17 awsui_variant-normal_vjswe_1gf7k_65 awsui_link_vjswe_1gf7k_518" data-awsui-motion-trigger="hover" data-awsui-motion-target="" data-analytics-funnel-value="button:R258:" href="https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/Vonage-Epsagon-AWSMarketplace/?ref_=mp_homepage" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="awsui_content_vjswe_1gf7k_13 awsui_label_1f1d4_ocied_5">Learn more</span><span class="awsui_icon_vjswe_1gf7k_494 awsui_icon-right_vjswe_1gf7k_499 awsui_icon_h11ix_qwp97_13 awsui_size-normal-mapped-height_h11ix_qwp97_97 awsui_size-normal_h11ix_qwp97_93 awsui_variant-normal_h11ix_qwp97_181 awsui_name-external_h11ix_qwp97_219"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" data-awsui-icon-animated="true"><path d="M13 9.012v-6H7M13.02 3 7 9.01" class="stroke-linejoin-round awsui-icon-arrow"></path><path d="M3 5.012v8h8.01" class="stroke-linejoin-round"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="awsui_grid-column_14yj0_1iwrc_50"><div class="awsui_restore-pointer-events_14yj0_1iwrc_221"><div class="partners-story-image"><img src="https://d32gc0xr2ho6pa.cloudfront.net/img/partner/vonage.png" alt="Vonage" class="partners-story-img"/></div></div></div></div></div><div class="partners-logo-grid"><h2 class="awsui_root_18wu0_1waok_950 awsui_box_18wu0_1waok_24 awsui_h2-variant_18wu0_1waok_28 awsui_p-bottom-m_18wu0_1waok_407 awsui_color-inherit_18wu0_1waok_190 awsui_font-size-default_18wu0_1waok_40 awsui_font-weight-default_18wu0_1waok_81">More Stories</h2><div class="awsui_grid_14yj0_1iwrc_9"><div class="awsui_grid-column_14yj0_1iwrc_50"><div class="awsui_restore-pointer-events_14yj0_1iwrc_221"><a href="https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/EllieMae-AWSMarketplace/?ref_=mp_homepage" class="partners-logo-link" data-testid="partners-logo-link" aria-label="Find Out More Ellie Mae" data-analytics="Ellie Mae" data-analytics-type="eventDetail"><div class="partners-logo-tile"><div class="partners-logo-overlay" aria-hidden="true"><span>Find Out More</span></div><div class="partners-logo-img-container"><img src="https://d32gc0xr2ho6pa.cloudfront.net/img/partner/EllieMae_Logo.png" alt="" class="partners-logo-img"/></div><div class="partners-logo-name">Ellie Mae</div></div></a></div></div><div class="awsui_grid-column_14yj0_1iwrc_50"><div class="awsui_restore-pointer-events_14yj0_1iwrc_221"><a href="https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/Siemens-Energy-metaphacts-AWSMarketplace-case-study/?ref_=mp_homepage" class="partners-logo-link" data-testid="partners-logo-link" aria-label="Find Out More Siemens Energy" data-analytics="Siemens Energy" data-analytics-type="eventDetail"><div class="partners-logo-tile"><div class="partners-logo-overlay" aria-hidden="true"><span>Find Out More</span></div><div class="partners-logo-img-container"><img src="https://d32gc0xr2ho6pa.cloudfront.net/img/partner/Siemens_Energy_logo.png" alt="" class="partners-logo-img"/></div><div class="partners-logo-name">Siemens Energy</div></div></a></div></div><div class="awsui_grid-column_14yj0_1iwrc_50"><div class="awsui_restore-pointer-events_14yj0_1iwrc_221"><a href="https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/university-notre-dame-aws-marketplace-case-study/?ref_=mp_homepage" class="partners-logo-link" data-testid="partners-logo-link" aria-label="Find Out More University of Notre Dame" data-analytics="University of Notre Dame" data-analytics-type="eventDetail"><div class="partners-logo-tile"><div class="partners-logo-overlay" aria-hidden="true"><span>Find Out More</span></div><div class="partners-logo-img-container"><img src="https://d32gc0xr2ho6pa.cloudfront.net/img/partner/University_of_Notre_Dame.png" alt="" class="partners-logo-img"/></div><div class="partners-logo-name">University of Notre Dame</div></div></a></div></div><div class="awsui_grid-column_14yj0_1iwrc_50"><div class="awsui_restore-pointer-events_14yj0_1iwrc_221"><a href="https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/Ibotta-marketplace1/?ref_=mp_homepage" class="partners-logo-link" data-testid="partners-logo-link" aria-label="Find Out More Ibotta" data-analytics="Ibotta" data-analytics-type="eventDetail"><div class="partners-logo-tile"><div class="partners-logo-overlay" aria-hidden="true"><span>Find Out More</span></div><div class="partners-logo-img-container"><img src="https://d32gc0xr2ho6pa.cloudfront.net/img/partner/Ibotta_Logo.png" alt="" class="partners-logo-img"/></div><div class="partners-logo-name">Ibotta</div></div></a></div></div></div></div><p class="partners-case-studies-text">To see more examples of how we have helped businesses with their software needs, please visit the<!-- --> <a id="link-self:Re8H1:" data-testid="partners-case-studies-link" data-analytics="partners-more-case-studies" data-analytics-type="eventDetail" class="awsui_link_4c84z_1xwtn_9 awsui_variant-primary_4c84z_1xwtn_145 awsui_font-size-body-m_4c84z_1xwtn_393" data-analytics-funnel-value="link:Re8:" data-awsui-motion-trigger="hover" data-awsui-motion-target="" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://aws.amazon.com/marketplace/solutions/awsmp-all-case-studies?ref_=mp_homepage"><span>customer success stories page</span><span class="awsui_icon-wrapper_4c84z_1xwtn_460"> <span class="awsui_icon_4c84z_1xwtn_460" aria-label="Opens in a new tab" role="img"><span class="awsui_icon_h11ix_qwp97_13 awsui_icon-flex-height_h11ix_qwp97_21 awsui_size-normal_h11ix_qwp97_93 awsui_variant-normal_h11ix_qwp97_181 awsui_name-external_h11ix_qwp97_219"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" data-awsui-icon-animated="true"><path d="M13 9.012v-6H7M13.02 3 7 9.01" class="stroke-linejoin-round awsui-icon-arrow"></path><path d="M3 5.012v8h8.01" class="stroke-linejoin-round"></path></svg></span></span></span></a>.</p></div></section><section class="seller-banner-section" data-testid="seller-pitch-banner"><img src="https://d32gc0xr2ho6pa.cloudfront.net/img/general/v2/hp-sellerband-bg.jpg" alt="" class="seller-banner-bg-image"/><div class="seller-banner-content"><div class="seller-banner-inner"><h2 class="homepage-header-section-title seller-banner-heading">Sell in AWS Marketplace</h2><div class="seller-banner-paragraph"><p>AWS Marketplace provides a new sales channel for ISVs and Consulting Partners to sell their solutions to AWS customers. We make it easy for customers to find, buy, deploy and manage software solutions, including SaaS, in a matter of minutes.</p><p>Come find out how to list your product and leverage this channel today.</p></div><a data-testid="seller-banner-cta" data-analytics="seller-pitch-banner-cta" data-analytics-type="eventDetail" class="awsui_button_vjswe_1gf7k_17 awsui_variant-primary_vjswe_1gf7k_94 awsui_link_vjswe_1gf7k_518" data-awsui-motion-trigger="hover" data-awsui-motion-target="" data-analytics-funnel-value="button:R79:" href="https://aws.amazon.com/marketplace/management/tour/?ref_=hmpg_bottom_banner_sell"><span class="awsui_content_vjswe_1gf7k_13 awsui_label_1f1d4_ocied_5">Register Now</span></a></div></div></section></div><!--/$--></div></div>
